{"seq":3,"slug":"syndication-policy-rule","title":"搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-compliance/syndication-policy-rule","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵\">搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵</h1><p>前两篇把「哪些内容不合规」和「我们凭什么搬」分别判定了。但这两个判定目前还是<strong>逐条</strong>的：每条评论都要分别过一遍过滤规则与授权校验。当商品数量上百万、评论数量上千万时，逐条判定既跑不动也无法审计。真正让搬运可持续的，是把判定沉淀成一张<strong>可搬矩阵</strong>——用商品维度、市场维度、内容维度的乘积来表达准入策略，让绝大多数组合不需要逐条判定。</p>\n<p>可搬矩阵的价值不在于省算力，而在于<strong>可解释</strong>。当一个运营问「这条评论为什么不能搬到德国站」，答案应该是矩阵里某个确定格子的某条规则，而不是「模型说不行」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可搬矩阵是三个轴上的准入策略：<strong>商品轴</strong>（品类、品牌、是否为受管制商品）、<strong>市场轴</strong>（来源市场、目标市场）、<strong>内容轴</strong>（是否含声明、是否含禁忌、授权依据类型）。矩阵的每个格子存一个策略：允许、拒绝、或需附加条件（加注、改写、仅文本不含图片）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品轴取值</th>\n<th>市场轴示例</th>\n<th>内容轴条件</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通服饰</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 任意目标</td>\n<td>无声明、有协议授权</td>\n<td>允许（附标注）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化妆品</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 目标市场 A</td>\n<td>含功效声明</td>\n<td>改写为体验描述 + 加注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化妆品</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 目标市场 B</td>\n<td>含功效声明</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保健食品</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 任意目标</td>\n<td>含健康断言</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>母婴用品</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 任意目标</td>\n<td>含安全断言</td>\n<td>需可证实，否则拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含生产日期的食品</td>\n<td>任意来源 → 任意目标</td>\n<td>含保质期描述</td>\n<td>拒绝（时效失效）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[搬运请求&lt;br/&gt;商品×市场×内容] --&gt; B[查可搬矩阵]&#10;  B --&gt; C{格子策略}&#10;  C --&gt;|allow| D[进入展示管线]&#10;  C --&gt;|deny| E[拒绝并记录矩阵格子]&#10;  C --&gt;|conditional| F[执行附加条件]&#10;  F --&gt; G{条件满足?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| D&#10;  G --&gt;|否| E&#10;  D --&gt; H[写入展示记录&lt;br/&gt;含矩阵版本]&#10;  E --&gt; I[写入拒绝记录&lt;br/&gt;含矩阵版本与格子键]&#10;  H --&gt; J[定期抽样审计]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[搬运请求&lt;br/&gt;商品×市场×内容] --&gt; B[查可搬矩阵]\n  B --&gt; C{格子策略}\n  C --&gt;|allow| D[进入展示管线]\n  C --&gt;|deny| E[拒绝并记录矩阵格子]\n  C --&gt;|conditional| F[执行附加条件]\n  F --&gt; G{条件满足?}\n  G --&gt;|是| D\n  G --&gt;|否| E\n  D --&gt; H[写入展示记录&lt;br/&gt;含矩阵版本]\n  E --&gt; I[写入拒绝记录&lt;br/&gt;含矩阵版本与格子键]\n  H --&gt; J[定期抽样审计]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>矩阵的<strong>格子键</strong>（商品维度值 + 来源市场 + 目标市场 + 内容标签集合）是整套系统的核心标识。所有展示与拒绝记录都带上格子键与矩阵版本，审计时就能按格子统计，而不是面对一堆无结构的日志。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不能只靠内容审核模型\">为什么不能只靠内容审核模型</h3><p>纯模型判定有两个不可接受的性质：不可解释、不可版本化。合规判定需要向监管、向合作方、向用户解释依据；需要能回答「三个月前这条为什么被允许」。模型权重升级后，同样的输入会得到不同结论，而没有一条可追溯的规则变更记录。因此模型适合做<strong>内容标签的抽取</strong>（这段文本含不含功效声明），而策略决定权必须留在显式的规则矩阵里。</p>\n<p>规则矩阵的另一个价值是它能表达<strong>时间维度</strong>：规则带生效区间，历史判定用当时的版本解释。以美国的消费者评论规则为例，2024 年 8 月公布并随后生效的一套禁令把若干具体做法明确列为违法，包括明知是虚假或未经核实的评论仍予发布、以激励换取特定倾向的评价而不作披露、以及压制负面评论等，违反者面临每项违规的民事罚款（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2024/08/ftc-announces-final-rule-banning-fake-reviews-testimonials\">FTC 消费者评论与证言规则</a>）。这类规则一旦生效，昨天还合规的搬运行为今天就可能违规——只有当策略以带版本的规则表达时，系统才能回答「哪些已展示内容在新规则下不再合规」并批量处置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则的表达与求值\">规则的表达与求值</h2><h3 id=\"规则用声明式结构而非代码\">规则用声明式结构而非代码</h3><p>把准入策略写成声明式规则，而不是散落在业务代码里的条件分支。理由是策略的变更频率远高于代码：一次法规更新就要改一批规则，如果规则写在代码里，每次都要走完整的发布流程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"matrix_version: mx_2026_09_15&#10;rules:&#10;  - id: r_cosmetic_efficacy&#10;    when:&#10;      category: [cosmetics, skincare]&#10;      content_tags: [contains_efficacy_claim]&#10;    target_markets: [&#39;DE&#39;, &#39;FR&#39;, &#39;IT&#39;]&#10;    policy: conditional&#10;    conditions:&#10;      - action: rewrite&#10;        template: first_person_experience&#10;      - action: annotate&#10;        key: personal_experience_disclaimer_v2&#10;    severity: soft&#10;    legal_basis: EU_claims_regulation_scope&#10;  - id: r_supplement_health&#10;    when:&#10;      category: [supplements, health_food]&#10;      content_tags: [contains_health_claim]&#10;    target_markets: &#39;*&#39;&#10;    policy: deny&#10;    severity: hard&#10;    legal_basis: health_claims_prohibited&#10;  - id: r_default_allow&#10;    when: {}&#10;    target_markets: &#39;*&#39;&#10;    policy: allow&#10;    conditions:&#10;      - action: annotate&#10;        key: syndicated_source_label_v3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matrix_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mx_2026_09_15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">r_cosmetic_efficacy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cosmetics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">skincare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      content_tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">contains_efficacy_claim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_markets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conditional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rewrite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">first_person_experience</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">annotate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">personal_experience_disclaimer_v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">soft</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    legal_basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EU_claims_regulation_scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">r_supplement_health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">supplements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">health_food</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      content_tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">contains_health_claim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_markets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deny</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    legal_basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">health_claims_prohibited</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">r_default_allow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_markets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">annotate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">syndicated_source_label_v3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节决定了这套结构好不好用。<strong>默认规则显式写出</strong>（<code>r_default_allow</code>）而不是依赖兜底代码，这样「为什么这条被允许」也有规则可指。<strong><code>legal_basis</code> 必填</strong>，没有依据的规则会在复核时被质疑。<strong><code>severity</code> 区分硬软</strong>，硬规则不允许人工覆盖，软规则允许运营在留痕后覆盖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"求值顺序与冲突解决\">求值顺序与冲突解决</h3><p>多条规则可能同时匹配一条内容，必须有确定的冲突解决顺序。推荐顺序是：先硬拒绝，再软条件，最后默认允许；同优先级内按 <code>legal_basis</code> 的严格程度排序。关键是这个顺序要<strong>写进文档并进入测试</strong>，因为顺序变化会静默改变大量判定结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 矩阵求值：硬拒绝优先，其次条件，最后允许&#10;WITH matched AS (&#10;  SELECT r.*,&#10;         CASE r.severity WHEN &#39;hard&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 2 END AS tier,&#10;         CASE r.policy WHEN &#39;deny&#39; THEN 1 WHEN &#39;conditional&#39; THEN 2 ELSE 3 END AS policy_rank&#10;  FROM matrix_rule r&#10;  WHERE r.matrix_version = &#39;mx_2026_09_15&#39;&#10;    AND (r.target_markets = &#39;*&#39; OR :target_market = ANY(r.target_markets))&#10;    AND r.category_overlap &amp;&amp; :categories&#10;    AND r.content_tags @&gt; :content_tags&#10;)&#10;SELECT rule_id, policy, severity, conditions, legal_basis&#10;FROM matched&#10;ORDER BY tier ASC, policy_rank ASC, rule_id ASC&#10;LIMIT 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 矩阵求值：硬拒绝优先，其次条件，最后允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> matched</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hard'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'deny'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'conditional'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix_rule r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matrix_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mx_2026_09_15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_markets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :target_market </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_markets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_overlap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; :categories</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">content_tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :content_tags</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, severity, conditions, legal_basis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> matched</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, policy_rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rule_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ORDER BY tier, policy_rank, rule_id</code> 的最后一个 <code>rule_id</code> 是必要的 tie-breaker：没有它，两条同优先级规则命中时结果是非确定的，同一输入在不同时间会得到不同策略——这类不确定性在合规系统里是不可接受的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量执行与增量重算\">批量执行与增量重算</h2><h3 id=\"矩阵变更的影响面\">矩阵变更的影响面</h3><p>矩阵版本更新后，需要知道哪些已搬运的内容在新矩阵下策略改变。可行的做法是维护一张<strong>格子索引</strong>：把已搬运的 content 按其格子键聚合计数，矩阵更新时只需对受影响的格子做重扫，而不是全量重跑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 已搬运内容的格子分布，用于估算矩阵变更影响面&#10;SELECT&#10;  cell_key,&#10;  COUNT(*) AS syndicated_reviews,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE policy_applied = &#39;allow&#39;) AS currently_allowed&#10;FROM syndication_display_record&#10;WHERE revoked_at IS NULL&#10;GROUP BY cell_key&#10;ORDER BY syndicated_reviews DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已搬运内容的格子分布，用于估算矩阵变更影响面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cell_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> syndicated_reviews,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy_applied </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'allow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currently_allowed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> syndication_display_record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cell_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> syndicated_reviews </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询回答的是「改这个格子会影响多少条已展示内容」，是矩阵变更前的必备评估，也是决定灰度顺序的依据。影响面大的格子先灰度、先验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等与重放\">幂等与重放</h3><p>搬运执行必须是幂等的：同一条评论对同一市场重复执行应得到相同结果，不产生重复展示记录。实现方式是给展示记录加唯一键（评论 + 目标市场 + 矩阵格子），并用 upsert 写入。重放场景（例如上次执行中断）因此可以安全重跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计与举证\">审计与举证</h2><h3 id=\"每个决策留三元组\">每个决策留三元组</h3><p>任何一次准入决策都要能给出三元组：<strong>输入</strong>（商品、市场、内容标签）、<strong>规则</strong>（命中的规则 ID 与矩阵版本）、<strong>输出</strong>（策略与执行结果）。这三者构成举证的最小单元。缺少任何一项，争议发生时都无法自证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;sd_1f90&quot;,&#10;  &quot;input&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;peid&quot;: &quot;pe_4410&quot;,&#10;    &quot;target_market&quot;: &quot;de&quot;,&#10;    &quot;content_tags&quot;: [&quot;contains_efficacy_claim&quot;],&#10;    &quot;categories&quot;: [&quot;cosmetics&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;rule&quot;: { &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;r_cosmetic_efficacy&quot;, &quot;matrix_version&quot;: &quot;mx_2026_09_15&quot; },&#10;  &quot;output&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;policy&quot;: &quot;conditional&quot;,&#10;    &quot;conditions_applied&quot;: [&quot;rewrite:first_person_experience&quot;, &quot;annotate:personal_experience_disclaimer_v2&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;decided_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T03:02:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sd_1f90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"peid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pe_4410\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target_market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"content_tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"contains_efficacy_claim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"categories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cosmetics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r_cosmetic_efficacy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matrix_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mx_2026_09_15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"conditional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"conditions_applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rewrite:first_person_experience\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"annotate:personal_experience_disclaimer_v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decided_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T03:02:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"抽样审计要独立\">抽样审计要独立</h3><p>定期从已展示内容里抽样，用<strong>独立于生产规则</strong>的判定路径复核（人工或另一套规则）。这一步的目的不是找单条错误，而是估计生产规则的错误率，并发现系统性偏差——例如某类内容长期被过宽地放行。抽样结果要能反馈回矩阵，形成闭环。这与 <a href=\"destination-market-filter\">目的地市场合规过滤</a> 里的申诉推翻率监控互补：那个看被拦下的，这个看被放行的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可搬矩阵用商品、市场、内容三个轴表达准入策略；格子键是所有决策、展示与审计记录的公共标识。</li>\n<li>纯模型判定不可解释、不可版本化，模型应只负责内容标签抽取，策略决定权留在显式规则里。</li>\n<li>规则用声明式结构（YAML/JSON）而非代码，使法规更新不必走发布流程；默认允许规则显式写出。</li>\n<li>每条规则必须有 <code>legal_basis</code> 与 <code>severity</code>；硬规则不允许人工覆盖，软规则允许留痕覆盖。</li>\n<li>求值顺序（硬拒绝 → 条件 → 允许）必须写进文档并进入测试，且要有确定 tie-breaker，否则同输入会产生不同策略。</li>\n<li>矩阵变更前用格子索引评估影响面并按影响面灰度；搬运写入必须幂等，用唯一键加 upsert。</li>\n<li>每次决策留存「输入、规则、输出」三元组作为举证最小单元。</li>\n<li>抽样审计必须独立于生产规则，用于估计放行错误率，与申诉推翻率监控形成双向闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵","id":"搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能只靠内容审核模型","id":"为什么不能只靠内容审核模型"},{"level":2,"text":"规则的表达与求值","id":"规则的表达与求值"},{"level":3,"text":"规则用声明式结构而非代码","id":"规则用声明式结构而非代码"},{"level":3,"text":"求值顺序与冲突解决","id":"求值顺序与冲突解决"},{"level":2,"text":"批量执行与增量重算","id":"批量执行与增量重算"},{"level":3,"text":"矩阵变更的影响面","id":"矩阵变更的影响面"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等与重放","id":"幂等与重放"},{"level":2,"text":"审计与举证","id":"审计与举证"},{"level":3,"text":"每个决策留三元组","id":"每个决策留三元组"},{"level":3,"text":"抽样审计要独立","id":"抽样审计要独立"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UGC 授权与来源署名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-compliance/ugc-rights-attribution"},"next":{"title":"搬运评论排序与可信度加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-effect-trust/translated-review-rank"}}